\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Before/after sorting the count stayed \\\"6 entries\\\" and each row's Task Name/Priority/Due Date/Completed/Score values were unchanged (e.g. Zeta QA Audit | 5 | Mar 10, 2026 | check | 42 in every ordering).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Filtering not implemented, so inclusion/clearing behavior cannot hold\", \"actual\": \"No filter UI exists anywhere in the app (no \\\"filter\\\" string in the DOM, no filter control in table or card view), so there are no active criteria to satisfy and no filters to clear.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All 6 entries and every field value match between views; empty Score renders as \\\"—\\\" in both table cells and card rows.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Field-type dropdown options labeled \\\"Text\\\", \\\"Number\\\", \\\"Date\\\", \\\"Checkbox\\\". Add Entry form renders input[type=text] for Task Name, input[type=number] for Priority/Score, input[type=date] for Due Date, and a checkbox with Yes/No label for Completed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Form checkbox toggles between unchecked \\\"No\\\" and checked \\\"Yes\\\" (aria-checked). Table uses lucide-check (text-success) vs lucide-x (muted); cards show \\\"Yes\\\"/\\\"No\\\" with matching icons.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Quick search matches raw stored values, not displayed formatted values\", \"actual\": \"Entry displays date \\\"Mar 10, 2026\\\" and checkbox \\\"Yes\\\", but searching \\\"Mar 10\\\" returns \\\"0 entries matching\\\" and \\\"Yes\\\" returns \\\"0 entries matching\\\". Searching the internal raw values instead works: \\\"2026-03-10\\\" → 1 entry (Zeta QA